  "description": "Daring 700*32C Adult Road Bike\n\nHiland 6061 Aluminum Frame - Features light weight, easy handling and high durability.\nDouble Caliper Brakes - Ensures the riding safety.\n\n700*32C Tire - Suitable for different terrains.\n\nLight and Durable\n\nDaring features a high-quality ultralight aluminum frame for riding and moving with ease, corrosion resistant and very easy to clean and maintain.\n\nIt’s also more durable and potential for higher speeds, it can withstand a harder impact without cracking or failing.\n\nInternal shift cable and brake hose routing can help your cables last longer by protecting them from any environment, reduce wind resistance for higher speed.\n\nSafe Riding\n\nThe brake system consists of double caliper brakes which are lighter than disc brakes.\n\nIt can provide reliable and responsive stopping power, ensuring that riders stop immediately in case of emergency.\n\nIt is also easier to adjust and maintain.\n\nHigh-speed experience\n\n14-speed drivetrain provides precise and quick shifting with a wide range of gearing, so you always have the right gear for your terrain to enjoy riding.\n\n700C wheels have less rolling resistance, making them more efficient, so riders can ride further using the same amount of energy.\n\nPlus, the double wall rim also gives it strong tensile strength, allowing it to be more durable, so you can adapt to your terrain with ease.\n\nAssembly & Guide\n\n85% pre-assembled and easy to assemble within 25 minutes.\n\nThe delivery box includes free installation tools and pedals, WITHOUT kickstand. Click on the video to see an instructional video on assembly.\n\nProfessional Shimano Drivetrain\n\nShimano 14-speed system ensures smooth and precise gear shifts, allowing you to effortlessly tackle various terrains and optimize your performance on this road bike.\n\n6061 Aluminum Frame\n\nHiland lightweight aluminum alloy frame offers a perfect blend of strength and agility, providing a solid foundation for your road cycling journey.\n\n700*25C Tire\n\n700*25C tires strike the ideal balance between speed and stability, giving you a smooth and controlled ride experience on your road bike.\n\nCaliper Brakes\n\nDual caliper brakes are lighter and easy to adjust and maintain.\n\nUnleash your speed with the Hiland Daring Road Bike. Featuring a lightweight 6061 aluminum frame, Shimano 14-speed drivetrain, and high-performance 700c wheels. The ultimate racing bike for fitness and commuting.",
